---

<MarketingLayout
  title="NGO & Nonprofit Event Management Software | EventHex"
  description="Coordinate fundraising galas, awareness events, community programmes, volunteer-facing events, and nonprofit conferences with registration, ticketing, campaigns, websites, badges, check-in, and reporting."
  canonical="https://eventhex.ai/industries/ngo/"
  ogImage="/feature-images/event-registration-dashboard.png"
  footerCtaEyebrow="Plan your next NGO and nonprofit event"
  footerCtaTitle="See the workflow with your own event requirements"
  footerCtaSubtitle="Bring the format, audience, registration and access rules, programme, communication channels, onsite plan, and integration needs. We’ll show the supported EventHex path and identify anything that needs separate validation."
  footerCtaButtonText="Book a Demo"
  footerCtaHref="/book-a-demo/"
  footerCtaImageSrc="/feature-images/footer-cta-devices.webp"
  footerCtaImageAlt="EventHex event platform on laptop, tablet, and mobile"
  footerCtaImageLoading="lazy"
  showFooterCta={true}
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(softwareSchema)} />
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faqSchema)} />
  </Fragment>

  <div class="ngo-page">
    <section class="ngo-hero">
      <div class="ngo-hero__grid">
        <div class="ngo-hero__content">
          <span class="ngo-eyebrow animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInDown">Event management software for nonprofits and NGOs</span>
          <h1 class="ngo-hero__title animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp">
            Run nonprofit events with a clear registration, communication, and event-day workflow
          </h1>
          <p class="ngo-hero__lead animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp">
            Coordinate fundraising galas, awareness events, community programmes, volunteer-facing events, and nonprofit conferences with registration, ticketing, campaigns, websites, badges, check-in, and reporting.
          </p>
          <div class="ngo-hero__actions animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp">
            <a class="ngo-button ngo-button--dark" href="/book-a-demo/">Book a Demo <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            <a class="ngo-button ngo-button--quiet" href="#operating-map">See the operating model</a>
          </div>
          <div class="ngo-hero__proof animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeIn">
            <span>Flexible event access</span>
            <span>Audience communication</span>
            <span>Connected event day</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ngo-hero__visual animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInRight" aria-label="EventHex Platform Analytics overview showing event creation, registration, and check-in trends">
          <div class="ngo-hero__visual-card">
            <div class="ngo-hero__visual-inner">
              <img class="ngo-hero__analytics-image" src="/images/dashboard-poster.webp" alt="EventHex event dashboard showing registration, attendance, and ticket trends for nonprofit event operations" width="1280" height="762" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="operating-map" class="ngo-rail" aria-label="Event operating sequence">
      <div class="ngo-rail__inner">
        <span class="ngo-rail__label">Event operating sequence</span>
        <span class="ngo-rail__stat animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp"><b>Publish</b><small>Event website</small></span>
        <span class="ngo-rail__stat animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp" data-delay="50"><b>Invite</b><small>Audience segments</small></span>
        <span class="ngo-rail__stat animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp" data-delay="100"><b>Register</b><small>Forms + tickets</small></span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ngo-section ngo-spotlight ngo-connected">
      <div class="ngo-spotlight__header">
        <h2>Keep the attendee journey connected from invitation to follow-up</h2>
        <p>Give each event a clear path through registration, content, arrival, participation, and communication.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ngo-connected__quad">
        <article class="ngo-connected__cell ngo-connected__cell--copy">
          <div class="ngo-spotlight__copy animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp">
            <span class="ngo-card-kicker">{connectedCards[0].kicker}</span>
            <h3>{connectedCards[0].title}</h3>
            <p>{connectedCards[0].body}</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <div class="ngo-connected__cell ngo-connected__cell--media animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInRight">
          <img src={connectedCards[0].image} alt={connectedCards[0].alt} width={connectedCards[0].width} height={connectedCards[0].height} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </div>
        <div class="ngo-connected__cell ngo-connected__cell--media animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInLeft">
          <img src={connectedCards[1].image} alt={connectedCards[1].alt} width={connectedCards[1].width} height={connectedCards[1].height} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </div>
        <article class="ngo-connected__cell ngo-connected__cell--copy">
          <div class="ngo-spotlight__copy animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp">
            <span class="ngo-card-kicker">{connectedCards[1].kicker}</span>
            <h3>{connectedCards[1].title}</h3>
            <p>{connectedCards[1].body}</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <span class="ngo-connected__cross" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="-14 -14 28 28">
            <path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="var(--ngo-line)"></path>
            <path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="var(--ngo-line)" transform="scale(1,-1)"></path>
            <path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="var(--ngo-line)" transform="rotate(90)"></path>
            <path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="var(--ngo-line)" transform="rotate(-90)"></path>
          </svg>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="ngo-connected__quad ngo-connected__quad--secondary">
        <article class="ngo-connected__cell ngo-connected__cell--copy">
          <div class="ngo-spotlight__copy animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp">
            <span class="ngo-card-kicker">{connectedCards[2].kicker}</span>
            <h3>{connectedCards[2].title}</h3>
            <p>{connectedCards[2].body}</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <div class="ngo-connected__cell ngo-connected__cell--media animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInRight">
          <img src={connectedCards[2].image} alt={connectedCards[2].alt} width={connectedCards[2].width} height={connectedCards[2].height} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </div>
        <div class="ngo-connected__cell ngo-connected__cell--media animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInLeft">
          <img src={connectedCards[3].image} alt={connectedCards[3].alt} width={connectedCards[3].width} height={connectedCards[3].height} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </div>
        <article class="ngo-connected__cell ngo-connected__cell--copy">
          <div class="ngo-spotlight__copy animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp">
            <span class="ngo-card-kicker">{connectedCards[3].kicker}</span>
            <h3>{connectedCards[3].title}</h3>
            <p>{connectedCards[3].body}</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <span class="ngo-connected__cross" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="-14 -14 28 28">
            <path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="var(--ngo-line)"></path>
            <path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="var(--ngo-line)" transform="scale(1,-1)"></path>
            <path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="var(--ngo-line)" transform="rotate(90)"></path>
            <path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="var(--ngo-line)" transform="rotate(-90)"></path>
          </svg>
        </span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ngo-section ngo-workflow">
      <div class="ngo-workflow__inner">
        <header class="ngo-workflow__header">
          <span class="ngo-eyebrow">Audience experience</span>
          <h2><span class="ngo-workflow__title-line">Connect the moments attendees</span><span class="ngo-workflow__title-line">actually move through</span></h2>
        </header>
        <ol class="ngo-workflow__steps">
          {audienceSteps.map((step, index) => (
            <li>
              <details open={index === 0}>
                <summary>
                  <span>0{index + 1}</span>
                  <div class="ngo-workflow__content">
                    <h3>{step.title}</h3>
                    <p>{step.desc}</p>
                  </div>
                  <button type="button" class="ngo-workflow__arrow" aria-label={`${index === 0 ? "Collapse" : "Expand"} ${step.title}`} aria-expanded={index === 0 ? "true" : "false"}>
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 7.5 5 5 5-5"></path></svg>
                  </button>
                </summary>
                <div class="ngo-workflow__visual">
                  <img src={step.image} alt={step.alt} width={step.width} height={step.height} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                </div>
              </details>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <script>
      document.querySelectorAll<HTMLDetailsElement>(".ngo-workflow details").forEach((item, _, all) => {
        const summary = item.querySelector("summary");
        const trigger = item.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>(".ngo-workflow__arrow");
        summary?.addEventListener("click", (event) => {
          event.preventDefault();
          item.open = !item.open;
        });
        item.addEventListener("toggle", () => {
          trigger?.setAttribute("aria-expanded", String(item.open));
          trigger?.setAttribute("aria-label", `${item.open ? "Collapse" : "Expand"} workflow step`);
          if (!item.open) return;
          all.forEach((other) => { if (other !== item) other.open = false; });
        });
      });
    </script>

    <section class="ngo-eventday-stack" aria-labelledby="ngo-eventday-stack-title">
      <div class="ngo-eventday-stack__inner">
        <header class="ngo-eventday-stack__header">
          <div class="ngo-eventday-stack__eyebrow">
            <span class="ngo-eventday-stack__eyebrow-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M10.5 3c.4 2.6 1.2 4.3 2.4 5.5S15.9 10.1 18.5 10.5c-2.6.4-4.3 1.2-5.6 2.5S10.9 15.9 10.5 18.5c-.4-1.3-.9-2.7-2.5-5.6S5.1 10.9 2.5 10.5c2.6-.4 4.3-1.2 5.5-2.5S10.1 5.6 10.5 3Z" fill="#4F8CFF"/><path d="M17.5 13c.2 1.3.6 2.1 1.2 2.8s1.5 1 2.8 1.2c-1.3.2-2.1.6-2.8 1.2s-1 1.5-1.2 2.8c-.2-1.3-.6-2.1-1.2-2.8s-1.5-1-2.8-1.2c1.3-.2 2.1-.6 2.8-1.2s1-1.5 1.2-2.8Z" fill="#B08BFF"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span>During the event</span>
          </div>
          <h2 id="ngo-eventday-stack-title">
            <span class="ngo-eventday-stack__title-line">Keep event-day actions tied to the same</span>
            <span class="ngo-eventday-stack__title-line"><span class="ngo-eventday-stack__highlight">event record</span></span>
          </h2>
        </header>

        <div class="ngo-eventday-stack__cards" id="ngo-eventday-stack-cards">
          {eventDayCards.map((card, index) => (
            <article class="ngo-eventday-stack__card" data-card-index={index} style={`--card-index: ${index};`}>
              <div class="ngo-eventday-stack__copy">
                {card.eyebrow && <span class="ngo-eventday-stack__tag">{card.eyebrow}</span>}
                <h3>{card.title}</h3>
                <p>{card.desc}</p>
                <a href={card.link} class="ngo-eventday-stack__button">Explore More <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
              </div>
              <div class="ngo-eventday-stack__image">
                <img src={card.image} alt={card.alt} width={card.width} height={card.height} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              </div>
            </article>
          ))}
          <div class="ngo-eventday-stack__spacer" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <script>
      const eventDayStack = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>(".ngo-eventday-stack");
      const eventDayStackHeader = eventDayStack?.querySelector<HTMLElement>(".ngo-eventday-stack__header");
      const eventDayStackCards = eventDayStack?.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>(".ngo-eventday-stack__card");
      const eventDayStackFinalCard = eventDayStackCards?.[eventDayStackCards.length - 1];

      if (eventDayStackHeader && eventDayStackFinalCard) {
        let eventDayFrame = 0;
        const syncEventDayRelease = () => {
          eventDayFrame = 0;
          const stickyTop = Number.parseFloat(getComputedStyle(eventDayStackFinalCard).top) || 0;
          const releaseOffset = Math.min(0, eventDayStackFinalCard.getBoundingClientRect().top - stickyTop);
          eventDayStackHeader.style.setProperty("--ngo-eventday-release-y", `${releaseOffset}px`);
          eventDayStackHeader.style.transform = `translateY(${releaseOffset}px)`;
        };
        const queueEventDayRelease = () => {
          if (eventDayFrame) return;
          eventDayFrame = requestAnimationFrame(syncEventDayRelease);
        };

        window.addEventListener("scroll", queueEventDayRelease, { passive: true });
        window.addEventListener("resize", queueEventDayRelease, { passive: true });
        syncEventDayRelease();
      }
    </script>

    <section class="ngo-boundary ngo-boundary-ai" aria-labelledby="ngo-boundary-ai-title">
      <div class="ngo-boundary-ai__inner">
        <div class="ngo-boundary-ai__left">
          <span class="ngo-eyebrow">Build the right scope</span>
          <h2 id="ngo-boundary-ai-title">
            <span class="ngo-boundary-ai__title-line">Keep EventHex responsibility</span>
            <span class="ngo-boundary-ai__title-line">separate from <span>specialist requirements</span></span>
          </h2>
          <p>Configure the supported event, audience, access, content, communication, engagement, and event-day mechanisms. Map legal, regulatory, accreditation, identity, accessibility, venue, payment-provider, and industry-specific obligations to the teams and systems responsible for them.</p>
          <div class="ngo-boundary-ai__actions">
            <a href="/book-a-demo/" class="ngo-boundary-ai__button ngo-boundary-ai__button--dark">Plan my event <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            <a href="#faq" class="ngo-boundary-ai__button ngo-boundary-ai__button--light">Review scope <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ngo-boundary-ai__right">
